    {
      "concept": "server.keepalives",
      "reason": "Live round trip failed 2026-11-04 on the pinned YugabyteDB 2025.2.2.2 (YSQL) demo: the contract default keepalives=true reaches libpq as 'True' ('invalid integer value \"True\" for connection option \"keepalives\"'). Predates this form: the legacy registration route carries the same default."
